**Title:** Moonlit Shoreline: A Journey with Finn and Zephyr

**Description:** In this soothing episode, we journey alongside Finn, an eleven-year-old boy who embodies the virtues of patience and acceptance. As the sun sets over a tranquil coastal shoreline, Finn finds solace in the companionship of Zephyr, a playful dolphin. Together, they meander along the ocean's edge, discovering the beauty in life's simple treasures and learning to trust the world's gentle rhythms. Designed to lull you into a peaceful slumber, this episode invites you to let go of daily worries, embracing the calming embrace of the ocean's lullaby and the tender bond of friendship. Drift away with Finn and Zephyr as they navigate an evening of quiet contentment, reminding us of the beauty that lies in patience and the stillness of acceptance.

